l, federation and period style bathrooms. All the elegance of a bygone era with a unique contemporary twist, a back to wall pan to facilitate easy cleaning! Available as Back or Bottom Inlet.</div><div>Subdued detailing ensures Impero's design elements work seamlessly with your choice from Studio Bagno's range of Traditional style consoles, basins or pedestal basins. </div><div>The Impero suite features Cleanmax nanotech anti-bacterial surface glaze technology, preventing surface dirt accumulation and bacteria breeding.</div><div><b>Notes: </b></div><div><b>Made in Italy by </b><a href=\"https://www.studiobagno.com.au/olympia-ceramica-studio-bagno\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Olympia Ceramica</a></div><div>Set out 80 - 160 mm (S-Trap)</div><div>Suitable for S-Trap or P-Trap Installation.</div><div>Cleanmax nanotech anti-bacterial surface technology.</div><div>Includes soft close seat (made in Germany)</div><div>Black soft close seat also available (an additional +$160 Inc GST)</div></div>","sourceRecordCount":1,"captureDate":"2026-11-01","availability":null}
